{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12419","headline":"送锺评事应宏词下第东归 · 钱起","name":"送锺评事应宏词下第东归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳岁归人嗟转蓬，含情回首灞陵东。\n蛾眉不入秦台镜，鷁羽还惊宋国风。\n世事悠扬春梦里，年光寂寞旅愁中。\n劝君稍尽离筵酒，千里佳期难再同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}